Dear Players,

We are excited to launch our [i][u]Xmas Event[/u][/i], filled with exclusive deals and bonuses to elevate your gameplay. Here’s what’s in store for you:

[olist]
[*][b]Tasty Snowmen[/b]: Turn into Snowmen and eat 10 players to get a powerful Freeze Device;
[*][b]Tasty Snowmen #2[/b]: Turn into Snowmen and eat 30 players to obtain a powerful device that reduces your cooldowns;
[*][b]Xmas Special Title[/b]: Turn into Snowmen and eat 100 players to obtain the special The Grinch title;
[*][b]Snowball Launcher[/b]: Collect 25 candies to get a Snowball Launcher;
[*][b]Daily Xmas Chest[/b]: Collect 30 candies to get a Sapphire Chest;
[*][b]Xmas Purchase Bonus[/b]: Collect 300 candies to receive a one-time BIG BONUS on a coin pack purchase;
[*][b]Candies for Gold[/b]: Collect 500 candies to get 2000 coins;
[*][b]Xmas Laboratory Upgrade[/b]: Collect 3000 candies to get tripled crafts from the Laboratory for 5 days;
[*][b]Xmas Gift[/b]: Collect 3000 candies to obtain the "Santa's Golden Bracelet 2024";

[b]"Santa's Golden Bracelet 2024" stats:[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Rejoin[/b]: 30%
[*][b]Speed[/b]: 30%
[*][b]Eat Distance[/b]: 35%
[*][b]Eat Resistance[/b]: 30%
[*][b]Persistance[/b]: 35%
[/list]
[/olist]Remember, these offers are only available until January 7th. Make the most of this opportunity!

XMAS LIMITED EQUIPS:
For the entire duration of the event, at random time some [b]special equipment[/b] may be added. They can be purchased for a [u]short period of time only[/u], then they [u]will disappear forever[/u].

[i][b]XMAS DAY GIFT[/b][/i]
To show our appreciation for the dedicated players of Mitosis and their contributions to the game, a special event has been planned. On Christmas Day, players holding a premium pass will receive an [u][b]EXCLUSIVE GIFT[/b][/u], tailored to their pass level. The higher your pass level, the more substantial your Christmas gift will be!

Thank you for playing Mitos.is
Merry Christmas and Happy New Year!

Mitos.is Staff

